 and any freeze that does [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]occur is captured by the stall watchdog.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]tui_freeze_render_path_git.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/tui_freeze_render_path_git.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e4[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e4/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read-only workspace directory probe API[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]probe[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]probe: add a side-effect-free workspace path resolver to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workspace_provider so callers can ask where a workspace is without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]materializing it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Convert agent-detail hint rendering to the probe API[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]hints[dim] · [dim][/dim]after probe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hints: make the prompt-panel hint and clan/family render paths resolve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workspace dirs read-only, removing git subprocesses from the UI thread.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Audit remaining TUI resolution call sites[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sweep[dim] · [dim][/dim]after probe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sweep: find every other keystroke, render, and completion path that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]materializes a workspace and move it to a read-only probe or a tracked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]background task.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Regression guard against materialization on the UI thread[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after hints, sweep[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]guard: add a runtime guard plus tests so a future change cannot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reintroduce clone/fetch/push work into a render or keystroke path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Close the stall-watchdog forensics gap[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]watchdog[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]watchdog: explain and fix why a reported multi-second freeze produced no[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record, so future freezes are always diagnosable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reduce agents-tab reload cost[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]loader[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]loader: cut the full agents reload disk stage down from multi-second so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-launch and auto-refresh updates stop reading as unresponsiveness.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-e4","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-e4.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8332f80b1525c576e73749a25ffdf103","started_at":"2026-08-02T13:20:00.220666+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"279e69eaa938945351216f6ff0dd02756262898fd09dd14d8bd4559cdedce371","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-e4.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":